            "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:21:40.581523+00:00",
            "notes": "[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) is your main focus for this Round, [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is a must for this. You'll be getting **Rally** maybe twice this Round if you play smart so make sure the first time you get it to use it the first team fight you can.\n\nWe're not waiting for opportunities to use our **Rally** we're creating them - by using **Rally** as soon as possible you get the 10% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) from  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) which will be beneficial.\n\nIf you can't afford [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) it's fine, just make sure to buy [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) instead.",
