            "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:21:40.581523+00:00",
            "notes": "[Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) is our main source of **Rally Generation**. By combining it with [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) you should be getting between 20% to 50% from every time you use shield.\n\nYou want to **Shield Bash** , **Shield Boomerang** , **Whip Shot** to get the most value. Aim around the middle to closer to the bottom of the enemy to guarantee the **Shield Boomerang** hits twice securing the most amount of **Ultimate Percent**.\n\nWe sacrifice our [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) here because of how strong [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) and [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) are together. With a 20% increased **Rally** duration you should be able to generate more **Ultimate Percent** during **Rally** - make sure to be using **Shield Boomerang** as much as possible during your **Rally** to secure up to 30% **Ultimate Percent** minimum, optimally you can get this to 50% if you shoot in larger crowds.\n\nOnly buy [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) if you have the money after buying everything else, then if you still have more you can buy [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) which make sure to use **Rally* as soon as you can during team fights to activate its potential.\n\nAfter running tests I found that [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) is more beneficial than [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) so we don't need that yet but will eventually.",
