            "notes": "[Ability Power](stat_ability_power) is the focus for this Round - as much as you might want to get [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) here after running tests I found it more beneficial to focus [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) this round. \n\n[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is a must followed by [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418). If you have enough for [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) make sure to get that for not just the [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) but the [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) because we're going to want **Shield Boomerang** more.\n\nLike other Rounds just remember to use [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) to get your **Shield Health** back so it doesn't break, as long as you're using **Shield Boomerang** as much as possible this won't be a struggle.",
