            "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:21:40.581523+00:00",
            "notes": "[Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) is the final piece to this - during **Rally** you should be easily able to get 35% to 45% **Ultimate Percent** now due to the cooldowns. We want to be using our **Rally** as soon as possible now because as long as you're fighting during it you should be getting enough **Ultimate Percent** back that the next team fight you should be getting it after 2 to 3 **Shield Boomerang** shots - due to the low cooldown you shouldn't worry about using **Rally** , it's now a 5th ability.\n\n[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) is finally bought, it's useful to keep [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) though. Any extra **Cash** will be spent towards items like [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for the [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) or [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) if you prefer that. If you have enough **Cash** for both then get both , if you have not enough for either just get  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).",
