            "notes": "[Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) is obvious why it's used here - with a bigger shield it allows us to become more tanky and push more while getting more hits during **Rally** , this will allow you to **Stun** more enemies and get **Shield Boomerang** value better.\n\n[Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is finally sold to upgrade to [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) to get more [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). If you got enough **Cash** you can buy also [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) or [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). With the survivability already provided from [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) now synergising with [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) I prefer [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) for the extra [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) allowing you do more **Shield Boomerang** shots during **Rally**.\n\nRemember you're not immortal and can still be killed if you're not using [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) enough but you should be fine as long as you spam **Rally**. With how quick you get **Rally** now you can use it to kill even one person if you're able to get it back quick - with how easy it is to just shoot **Shield Boomerang** into a crowd of enemies it becomes easy to get even 20% **Ultimate Percent** from one **Shield Boomerang** so its up to you.",
